     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\">Hi,</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\">I would like to get bootstrapped CIs for my estimates (especially a total and an indirect effect in a mediation model), but I need to use a robust estimator (mlm) because of non-normality of the data.</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\">Is there a possibility to do both at the same time? se = &quot;bootstrap&quot; and estimator = &quot;mlm&quot; does not work at the same time. I tried to first estimate the lavaan object with mlm and afterwards bootstrap SE/CIs with the bootstrapLavaan() function. It works, but I don&#39;t get the values for the total1 (total1 := c1 + (a1 * b1)) and indirect1 (indirect1 := a1 * b1), only the values for a1, b1 and c1.</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\">Can I specify something in the bootstrapLavaan()-function to also bootstrap indirect1 and total1? Or is there another possibility I am missing?</p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\"><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(36,41,46);font-family:-apple-system,system-ui,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;;font-size:14px\">Best,<br style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Michael</p></div>"
